5,1,1,talk,Shion,,The current state of the break room is inefficient. It's trying to be everything and failing at all of it. We need a formal purpose to stop the chaos from leaking into our workspace.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. It's been a bit overwhelming lately. Maybe if we have a clear rule, it would be easier for everyone to get along.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,It's like a big toy box where nobody puts the toys back! We need a real plan so it's fair for everyone and not just a mess for one person to clean up.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is true that the room is in disarray, but let us remember that a space is more than its function. It should be a place where our spirits can breathe and connect.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Function is the priority here. If the room is a mess, it's because the current arrangement is unsustainable. We need to look at the actual costs and the time we're losing to this inefficiency.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, for once we agree. Logic dictates we analyze the data before deciding. I suggest we look into the physical disturbances and usage patterns to see exactly where the friction lies.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, if we're looking at data... maybe we should check the costs too? I'm worried about how much we're spending. It would be better to see the actual figures on paper first.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually using the room and who is leaving the mess! Let's check the tally of use and those crumbs at the desks to see what's really happening.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"While data is useful, let us not forget the human element. I wish to understand where our conversations have faltered and how we have been interacting in this space lately.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with the need for data. To understand the true cost of this inefficiency, I want to look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the facilities callouts on this floor.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your focus on crumbs is a start, but we need a broader view. I'll examine the partition wall to the office and the facilities callouts to quantify the noise and structural issues.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire. I just want to be sure we know the financial side of things before we decide.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, crumbs are a big deal! If we don't know who's making the mess, it's not fair. I'm sticking with the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened. Understanding the silence between us is as vital as understanding the noise.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, @Shion, it seems we have a good spread of data. I will stick with the invoices for outside hire and the facilities callouts to see where the labor hours are actually disappearing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,It seems we have our assignments. I will focus on the partition wall and the facilities callouts. Let's see if the data supports my intuition about the noise leaking into the office.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll do my best to find the information on the fit-out quotes and the outside hire invoices. I hope it helps us make a decision that doesn't cause any more trouble.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! I'll find out who's using the room and who's leaving the crumbs. We're going to make this room super fair for everyone, just you wait and see!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I look forward to seeing what we discover. May our findings lead us not only to a tidy room, but to a deeper understanding of one another. I shall see you all soon.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let's proceed. I will focus on the labor and maintenance costs. Once we have the facts, we can determine which purpose for the room minimizes wasted time and effort for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
