60,3,1,talk,Shion,,"The choice is obvious. Option B is the only one that addresses the noise pollution and the financial waste. A kitchen is a mess, and a quiet room doesn't solve our external hire costs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. Option B seems like the safest choice. If we have a professional meeting space, we can stop those outside payments and have everything documented properly. It feels like the most stable solution for us.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I like Option B too! A shared calendar means nobody can just hog the room, and it's way easier to keep a table clean than a kitchen. Let's make it a fair meeting space!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"While I agree that Option B provides the structure we need, let us promise that this room will not be for business alone. It must be a place where we can heal our silences.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the most rational choice. It eliminates the time wasted on external travel and the hidden labor of kitchen maintenance. It is the only option that optimizes our collective hours and resources.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, your sentiment is irrelevant to the structural utility of the room. The goal is to stop the noise and the waste. Option B is the only logical path forward. I'm voting for B.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll vote for B as well. It's the only way to stop the monthly payments and have a clear, professional setup. I feel much more comfortable with a solution that's based on the actual figures.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm voting for B too! With a calendar, everyone gets a turn and nobody has to be the ""cleaning fairy"" for a messy kitchen. It's the fairest way to do it!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall also vote for Option B. Though it is a room for meetings, let us use it to meet each other's hearts and resolve our differences in peace. I vote for B.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I concur. Option B minimizes the risk of unpaid upkeep and removes the inefficiency of off-site travel. It is the only choice that protects our time and labor. I vote for B.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Since everyone has already expressed their agreement and cast their votes for Option B, there is no further need for debate. The logic is sound, and the decision is unanimous.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
71,3,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm glad we could all agree. It's a relief to have a clear plan that makes sense financially. I'll support Option B.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
73,3,3,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
74,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agree! Now we can finally have a room that's fair for everyone and doesn't have crumbs everywhere. I'm super happy!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
75,3,3,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
76,3,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a blessing when we find common ground. Let us enter this new space with open minds and kind hearts, remembering that the strongest walls are those built of trust. I vote for B.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The decision is final. Option B is the only choice that ensures our time is not wasted on unnecessary travel or hidden maintenance. I vote for B.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
78,3,3,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"May this room become a bridge that brings us closer, turning our professional proximity into true companionship. I am at peace with our decision.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
